flowchart LR
  accTitle: Nonconforming product
  found([Nonconformity found at incoming inspection]) --> tag[Batch tagged and moved to quarantine]
  tag --> rec[Nonconformity report opened]
  rec --> eval{Review board decision}
  eval -->|Use as is| dev[Deviation approved by the customer]
  eval -->|Rework| rw[Rework, then re-inspection]
  eval -->|Return| rtv[Return to vendor with a corrective action request]
  eval -->|Scrap| scrap[Scrap with a cost record]
  dev --> close([Report closed, trend data updated])
  rw --> close
  rtv --> close
  scrap --> close
